  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "桜公園",
    "id": "2138",
    "timezone": "2"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「桜の季節ですわね……わたしの名前と『おそろい』で、一年のうちで一番好きな時期ですわ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「きのうは曇り空で、どうなることかと思っていましたけど。ちゃんと快晴になってよかった♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「年に一度しかない『花見大会』ですものね。中止になってしまうには、惜しいですわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「ああ、『花見大会』……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「この桜並木をわたしと家族のみんなで並んで歩いたのが、ついきのうのことのように思えますわね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「お姉さまたちと並んで歩きながら……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「桜の花びらを拾って、わたしの名前と同じだって思いながら、子供ながらに世を儚むこともありましたわね……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「ふふふ。懐かしい……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「それにしても、ゴミがたくさん落ちてますわね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「桜を見ながら『どんちゃん騒ぎ』するのはかまいませんけど、せめてゴミは自分で片づけてほしいですわね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「おや。拾ってくださってありがとうございます。どなたか存じませんが、感謝いたします……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「って、見慣れた顔ですわね……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「ええと、もしかして、さいきん君咲学院に転校してきた、転校生のひとでしょうか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「制服じゃありませんでしたから、はじめはわかりませんでしたけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「間違いありませんわね、転校生さん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「あなたもいらしてたなんて……奇遇ですわね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「ああ……警戒、しなくとも大丈夫ですわ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「わたしはたしかに、学校では『陛下』側に立つことが多いですが……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「目の敵にしているわけでは、ありませんので」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「そこのところ、混同しないようにお願いします」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「そうですわね。ここで会ったのも何かの縁……清掃を手伝ってはもらえないでしょうか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「ボランティア活動というわけではないんですけど。わたしは妙にきれい好きと言いますか……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「潔癖なので、『花見大会』を楽しみに来たつもりが、気付いたら清掃をはじめてしまっていたんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「もし、手伝ってもらえるのなら、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「お礼に、お菓子やジュースでよければ差し上げましょう♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「お菓子で釣るなんて、子供相手の対応でしょうか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「同世代の男性と関わったことがほとんどないので、失礼なことを言っていたら、申し訳ないですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「もちろん、ボランティアなので強制はしませんわ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「でも……あなたのほんのすこしの暇と善意を預けていただけるなら、有意義に使わせていただきますわ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「……ふむふむ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「転校生さん、あなたは……お姉さんと一緒にお花見に来るつもりだったのに、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「お姉さんに急用が入ったからひとりで行くことになった、と」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「『花見大会』のなかの企画で、うちの高校の軽音ライブがあったから、それを見に来るつもりだった、と」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「そういう事情があったんですね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「ひとりで花見というのも、まわりがにぎやかなぶん、さびしいでしょう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「名案がありますわ。わたしを『お姉さん』だと思って付き合ってもらう、というのはどうでしょう♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「わたしは、あなたのお姉さんにはなれないでしょうけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「対立候補にくみするものとして、警戒されるのは悲しいですから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「いえ。こちらの話ですわ。むかし、いちぶの生徒に厳しくしてたことがあって……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「そのことを後悔してるからこそ、きっとできるだけ、仲良くしておきたいんですわ、わたしは」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「清掃、手伝ってくれるみたいで嬉しいですわ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「まるで、わたしの過去のあやまちを、許してくれたみたい♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「さて。さっそく公園の入り口にあるゴミ箱からあふれたゴミを、袋に入れていきましょうか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「けっこうな量のゴミですから、骨が折れそうですわね……だからこそ、やりがいがあるのですけどね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「それが終わったら、出し物を見に行ってみましょうか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「軽音部のひとたちも、さすがに一般市民の前では、迷惑はかけないでしょうし……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-sp-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sp-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「転校生さん。あなたがやさしいひとで……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「わたしを手伝ってくれて、とっても嬉しいですわ♪」"
  }
]